The contents of this directory — the device matrix, the recipe corpus and their
schemas — are dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal.

    https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/

To the extent possible under law, the author has waived all copyright and related
or neighbouring rights to this dataset.

This is deliberate and different from the licence on the code in this repository,
which is GPL-3.0-or-later. The dataset is meant to be absorbed without friction by
other reuse and repair projects — postmarketOS, LineageOS, OpenAndroidInstaller and
anyone else — and share-alike on a factual dataset would block exactly that.

Records are contributed by volunteers who are shown `docs/participation-note.md`
before they run anything. No serial numbers, IMEI, IMSI, MAC addresses, Android IDs
or ICCIDs are collected, by design: the collection scripts query an explicit
property allowlist rather than dumping device state.
